# Route: guide 47 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Tauren
# (1211 of 1222 eligible quests, 160.2 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 59 to
# 60, 17 quests, 0.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Orgrimmar): Orgrimmar -> near Orgrimmar -> Orgrimmar -> near Orgrimmar
# -> Orgrimmar.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Necklace Recovery (2283;
# Shadowforge Surveyor 35-36, Shadowforge Ruffian 36-37, Shadowforge Digger
# 35-36, Stonevault Rockchewer 36-37, Stonevault Oracle 37-38, Stonevault Cave
# Hunter 36-37); Shadowshard Fragments (7068; Shadowshard Rumbler 40-41,
# Shadowshard Smasher 41-42, Shadowshard Thunderer 38).
#
# Left out: A Donation of Runecloth (7824), A Donation of Runecloth (7836):
# the route takes them here but cannot finish them (the coverage report's
# missed quests).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Necklace Recovery, Take 2 (2284), Rig Wars (2841), Rig
# Wars (2841), The Royal Rescue (4003), For The Horde! (4974), Returning the
# Lost Satchel (5724), Hidden Enemies (5728), Hidden Enemies (5728), Slaying
# the Beast (5761), Slaying the Beast (5761), Changing Tastes (95697),
# Changing Tastes (95697).

